    "directions": [
      "In a deep frying pan, put oil on gas for deep frying.",
      "in a mixing bowl, take 2 cups of leftover rice.",
      "Mash it smooth with your hands, till it turns into sticky.",
      "Add onion, carrot, cabbage, coriander, grated ginger, green chili, coriander leaves, chat masala, roasted cumin powder, chili powder, chaat masala, salt, besan and give it a good mix, in between squeeze and then mix.",
      "Wet your hand and take a ball sized batter and deep fry them.",
      "Keep stirring occasionally, till they gets crisp and golden brown.Drain on paper towel.",
      "Serve hot with chutney or ketchup."
    ],
